username = "dregs18627870"
rating = 2.0
review_content = "I'm pretty embarrassed to even leave a review about this, but the changes that happened to this place are too drastic to avoid complaining. Another customer and I both stop here on our way to work each day. 

Over time, we've gotten a bit attached and take turns buying each other our morning coffee. Admittedly, I haven't worked up the courage to ask them out yet, but I was hoping to change this soon. I went to buy their drink today only for the new AI machine to spit out a matcha latte! They hate matcha! It made it look like I forgot that detail about them. 

Luckily, the machine messed up my order too, so they seemed to realize the error wasn't due to my memory. A worker never would've messed up that badly! Only giving two stars for the very nice worker who fixed the mixup for us. 
"
